Z||000000||Seanh||08-29-2000||01:57 PM||||Is it possible on a Fiero? Has anyone done this? And also, do you guys think I should TurboCharge or Supercharge this new North* Im going to put in here pretty soon? Given that I am going to do one or the other.<BR>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Currently upgrading to a NorthStar.||||reg||1
Z||000001||BBBAD GT||08-29-2000||02:14 PM||||Wow Sean, you are really out there in no-man's land.  First you have a twin turbo V6 (I'd still like to see pics), then you are putting a Northstar in her with either super or turbocharging.  I sure hope you are a master ASE tech, or just a guy with a ton of money to burn.  Goodluck.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
