Z||000031||stimpy||08-31-2000||07:09 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Seanh:<BR><B>Ill answer the rest of the questions tomarrow.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Need some time to do some research? Need to go check out your buddies collection of Car Craft and Sport Compact?  Jeez.  Just go get yourself a 10 second Honda Civic and kill all those mean Camaros. You know you can add 25 hp with just an exhaust tip! Fancy air filter is another 50 hp. I know this because I ... uh, I have the worlds fastest Honda, yeah, that's the ticket. It runs a se..six second quater mile at three hundered miles an hour. It has four, no SEVEN turbos and it's 431 cubic inches.  And my wife Morgan Fairchild bought me a pine tree air freshener that cost two dol... thousand dollars and it's better then Nitros. And I shift it through my six speed automatic.<P><BR>The moral of this story is,  "Give  up, kid, they're all laughing at you!"<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
