Z||000035||mrfixit58||08-31-2000||02:01 PM||||SBC = Small Block Chevy (283, 302, 305, 307, 327, 350, 400). <BR>BBC = Big Block Chevy (396-402, 427, 454).<BR>Short block = motor without heads. Therefore, even a BBC can be a "Short Block".<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
