Z||000038||Seanh||08-31-2000||06:21 PM||||I figured out the IMO thing, I just wasnt thinking. The sound system in that car. I tell about and hopfully get ya some picts of that one. I run the system off the Premier DEH-P900R. I have one 10" sub in a sealed and ported box up front. One 8" in the factory location under the dash. And 2 12's behind the seats. The front speakers are upgraded to 6x9's and the rears are 4x6's. I also added Midrages and componet Tweeters in the kickpanels. The system runs off 5 Primier Amps. 4 mounted in the bottem of the trunk and a board is placed over them so I can still haul some stuff in there. And the 5th is in the top of the trunk. I havent got everything installed yet. I also own a 90 Lexus GT250 that has a sound system in and Iv take First place this year. I took 8th out of 112 cars in the statewide competition. I dont know if anyone is interested in the system in the Lexus, but Its all done and complete. I will post some pics of the system once I get everything done.<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Currently upgrading to a NorthStar.||||reg||1
