Z||000046||spike||09-01-2000||10:52 AM||||A 12 speaker system in a Fiero is very possible. 1 in front, 2 in dash, 2 in door, 1 in center console and six behind the seats. 5 amps in the trunk is also possible. Simple make a intake duct to the outside to let fresh air in and your amps will be fine. With  a little thought anything can be done. Good luck Sean with the n* if you choose this route.<P>Mike<P>PS: I also make spelling mistakes once in a while, don't we all.||||reg||1
